<tr style="background:var(--gold-light)"><th style="padding:6px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--border)">Virtue</th><th style="padding:6px;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--border)">1-5</th><th style="padding:6px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--border)">One action to improve it</th></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Prudence (I discern before acting)</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center">___</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">___</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Justice (I give each their due)</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center">___</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">___</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Fortitude (I remain firm in the good)</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center">___</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">___</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">Temperance (I moderate my desires)</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border);text-align:center">___</td><td style="padding:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)">___</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Choose the virtue with the lowest score. That is your priority growth area this month.</p>

<h4>C. Dialogue with Thomas More</h4>
<p>Imagine you can speak with St. Thomas More from his cell in the Tower of London. You ask him: "How did you manage to stay firm when everyone asked you to yield?" Write his imaginary answer (8-10 lines) based on what you know of him and the virtues he lived.</p>
