<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Come, Holy Spirit,<br />
fill the hearts of your faithful<br />
and kindle in them the fire of your love.<br />
Grant me prudence to discern your will,<br />
justice to give each what they deserve,<br />
fortitude not to give up in the face of difficulties,<br />
and temperance to use well the gifts you have given me.<br />
Increase in me faith, hope, and charity,<br />
and make the fruits of your Spirit<br />
visible in my life.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

